(7202074, 1108867, 108069, '<td valign="top">Good thing this isn''t a scratch and sniff. Just kidding! I love Tacoma! Great museum as well. Very well seen and nice capture.</td>', 'Good thing this isn''t a scratch and sniff. Just kidding! I love Tacoma! Great museum as well. Very well seen and nice capture.', '2014-04-11 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202075, 1108866, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great catch. Quite interesting as well that the canvas resembles a cloud. Great stuff.</td>', 'Great catch. Quite interesting as well that the canvas resembles a cloud. Great stuff.', '2014-04-11 16:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202077, 1108860, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the bean. I like this composition. Not the normal perspective, as it arcs from corner to corner, creating a really interesting line with the sky, the reflected buildings cower away from the true buildings. Really nice shimmery light.</td>', 'Nice use of the bean. I like this composition. Not the normal perspective, as it arcs from corner to corner, creating a really interesting line with the sky, the reflected buildings cower away from the true buildings. Really nice shimmery light.', '2014-04-11 16:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202126, 1108866, 124815, '<td valign="top">We really have to be careful (myself included) to the trap of over sharpening and even using too much contrast. A perfectly nice image gets ruined by halos, but over processing. Do we do it because we can or because we need it? <br/>I like your image but the baking of it is too much</td>', 'We really have to be careful (myself included) to the trap of over sharpening and even using too much contrast. A perfectly nice image gets ruined by halos, but over processing. Do we do it because we can or because we need it? I like your image but the baking of it is too much', '2014-04-11 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202127, 1108791, 124815, '<td valign="top">A black border for a Venetian image is like a sacrilege instead of letting all flow</td>', 'A black border for a Venetian image is like a sacrilege instead of letting all flow', '2014-04-11 20:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202167, 1108750, 89774, '<td valign="top">Great concept and very well executed. Top 2</td>', 'Great concept and very well executed. Top 2', '2014-04-12 01:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202168, 1108854, 89774, '<td valign="top">Love this image. Perfect for the theme and one of the few where it is all reflection (with the small exception of the added texture and dimension coming from the grass). Top 2</td>', 'Love this image. Perfect for the theme and one of the few where it is all reflection (with the small exception of the added texture and dimension coming from the grass). Top 2', '2014-04-12 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7202169, 1108791, 89774, '<td valign="top">I came back to this one and gave it a higher score after I reread the criteria, where the majority of the image should be a reflection. Nice image, nicely done.</td>', 'I came back to this one and gave it a higher score after I reread the criteria, where the majority of the image should be a reflection. Nice image, nicely done.', '2014-04-12 01:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
